This is a third-party SwiftUI implementation. It is not an official macOS
release from the original PCL author and is not integrated with the CE C# core.
The original PCL author and contributors retain their respective rights.

macOS/LICENCE preserves the original LICENCE file from the revision above,
including its reference to the PCL distribution terms and its repository
usage guide. These terms have not been replaced by the root Apache License.

Source-derived resources include images from Plain Craft Launcher 2/Images/,
Font.ttf from Plain Craft Launcher 2/Resources/Font.ttf, and icons converted
from original XAML path geometry. The source-map.json files under Resources/
record the original XAML paths and geometry hashes. AppIcon.icns is derived
from the original PCL artwork. Original contributor attribution, including
HerobrineXia, is also retained in the application's About page.

